# The headline cross-graph join: diseases with a wdt:P2293 "genetic
# association" whose associated gene is also declared a bio:Gene in
# the gene catalog (gene.ttl).
#
# disease side: 4,188 P2293 associations.
# gene side:    91,871 `a bio:Gene` declarations in an 889k-triple graph.
#
# Inner iteration scans the full gene graph per outer row, so the
# naive cost is roughly 4,188 × 889,000 ≈ 3.7 × 10^9 ops. That's
# slow on the list-backed evaluator — expect multi-minute runtime
# without an indexed store (see docs/designissues/
# sparql-store-backend.md). Included here as a stress test of the
# stack-safe fix: the query completes without overflow, which
# pre-#95 was not true.
#
# For something that finishes in seconds, see 03_variant_on_chromosome.rq.
PREFIX wdt: <http://www.wikidata.org/prop/direct/>
PREFIX bio: <https://bioschemas.org/>

SELECT DISTINCT ?disease ?gene
WHERE {
  GRAPH <urn:kgx:disease> { ?disease wdt:P2293 ?gene }
  GRAPH <urn:kgx:gene>    { ?gene a bio:Gene }
}
LIMIT 25
